00:03:57.837 --> 00:03:58.938
I'm watching a border.

00:03:58.938 --> 00:03:59.973
These are things I care about

00:03:59.973 --> 00:04:01.774
for my future, my kids future.

00:04:01.774 --> 00:04:03.543
That's why we're all in this game.

00:04:03.543 --> 00:04:04.410
And we need to hold Donald

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:05.011
Trump accountable.

00:04:05.011 --> 00:04:06.246
And I hope sooner than later

00:04:06.246 --> 00:04:07.480
