00:04:09.015 --> 00:04:09.882
for us to move forward

00:04:09.882 --> 00:04:12.085
with a GOP 2.0 or call it what you want.

00:04:12.418 --> 00:04:13.720
We need a new direction

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:15.121
that allows us to capitalize

00:04:15.121 --> 00:04:17.924
on on the short term and very well said.

00:04:17.924 --> 00:04:19.292
And I think that I just want to issue

00:04:19.292 --> 00:04:20.293
