00:04:24.097 --> 00:04:25.531
He did poorly in these midterms,

00:04:25.531 --> 00:04:26.299
the insurrection.

00:04:26.299 --> 00:04:26.933
He comes back

00:04:26.933 --> 00:04:28.234
